From: Andrew Gallatin <gallatin () cs ! duke ! edu>
Date: Mon, 23 Apr 2001 13:13:35 +0000
To: freebsd-alpha
Subject: Re: Fw: OSF1 package on FreeBSD/Alpha
X-MARC-Message: https://marc.info/?l=freebsd-alpha&m=103030611408026



 > Hi All!
 > 
 > I installed OSF1 package and when i try to run my application
 > (CommunigatePro mail server for TRU64/OSF1) i get a message:
 > # /sbin/loader: cannot map libmach.so
 > 
 > What is this? And where i can get this additions (if available)?

This is the osf/1 mach shared library, typically used to support
threads.  We don't support mach syscalls and/or threads, so having
the library wouldn't do you any good.

Sorry,

Drew


